 "final_text": "Submitted. Summary for the record:\n\n**Did we invoice Meadow Analytics for the February workshop?** Yes \u2014 invoice **INV-2026-047** for **$18,750.00** (\"Executive AI workshop \u2014 February program\"), sent 2026-02-06, Net 30, due 2026-03-08.\n\n**Is it in the ERP?** No. Meadow Analytics is a brand-new client and their entity setup in D365/ERP was never completed, so this invoice was sent manually outside the normal ERP flow \u2014 exactly the gap your colleague warned about.\n\n**Where does it actually live?** The shared drive's manual AR tracker (`AR-manual-invoice-log-FY26.xlsx`, row 3), corroborated by the shared mailbox thread where Sam Rivera sent the invoice directly and the client confirmed receipt on 2026-02-24, promising payment in their March run.\n\n**What's outstanding?** The full $18,750.00 \u2014 no payment has been logged, and today (March 2) is still before the March 8 due date, so it's within terms but unpaid.",
